<title>USA: Applied Digital wins first order in Asia.</title>
<headline>Applied Digital wins first order in Asia.</headline>
<dateline>SAN DIEGO 1997-05-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Applied Digital Access Inc on Monday said Chunghwa Telecom Co Ltd of Taiwan has ordered Applied Digital's T3AS test and performance monitoring system, marking the company's first product order in Asia.</p>
<p>Financial terms of the order were undisclosed.</p>
</text>
